Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?DSH:=20the=20standalone=20host=20relays=20n?=
 =?UTF-8?q?otice=5Ftext,=20so=20its=20notice=20shows=20as=20who=20=C2=B7?=
