MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

graftling-dsh's plugin titled a host notice '[agents notice from …]' with the raw
message, which the browser module could not read as a notice, so DSH showed
'From Agent / Session' and the content only as plain text in its card. The host's
notice line now carries notice_text (title with the execution, Markdown content,
Facts) and the plugin relays it as the body; a host without it keeps the older title.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
